Cell["\<\
Anywhere a session calls DrawPD[MillettUnknot, {Gap -> 0.03}], \
KnoodleDraw[MillettUnknot] accepts the identical input (its DrawPD output is \
the left panel of the first comparison above):\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"6f0b0404-466f-4e42-abcf-c3a7ff5ced6b"],

